 <footer><p>By <a href="https://medium.com/@ProjectJupyter" class="p-author h-card">Project Jupyter</a> on <a href="https://medium.com/p/37d6ae621f83"><time class="dt-published" datetime="2016-01-08T23:36:01.000Z">January 8, 2016</time></a>.</p><p><a href="https://medium.com/@ProjectJupyter/notebook-4-1-release-37d6ae621f83" class="p-canonical">Canonical link</a></p><p>Exported from <a href="https://medium.com">Medium</a> on August 22, 2026.</p></footer></article></body></html>